      <wp:comment_content>I'm a bit late to the party on this post, but wanted to chime in and say how sad it will be to see you stop flying.  I hope the change won't be permanent!  I've always been an ardent admirer of your airborne adventures, and echo Chris's comment about your thoughtful approach to general aviation.  It's been refreshing to read your posts when most of what we're bombarded with on a daily basis is #StupidPilotTricks on Instagram.

--Ron</wp:comment_content>
